Wed Nov 04 08:46:49 UTC 2026 - Johannes Kastl <opensuse_buildservice@ojkastl.de>

- Update to version 0.7.0:
  * Added Features
    - Support SPDX "user defined license reference" (aka
      LicenseRef) [Issue #157] [PR #601]
    - Windows binary builds of grant / Windows as a supported
      platform [Issue #154] [PR #440]
  * Bug Fixes
    - update mergeDuplicatePackages call sites to new signature [PR
      #628]
    - windows-safe config discovery and OS-independent policy globs
      [PR #599]
    - use the license classifier directly instead of its tools
      backend [PR #598]
    - sign release checksums with a sigstore bundle [PR #594]
    - distinguish java packages sharing an artifact id [PR #571]
    - guard against panic on malformed SPDX license expression [PR
      #548]
    - bug: Grant fails to scan a RHEL9 container containing the
      'kernel-headers' package [Issue #122] [PR #601]
    - Follow/resolve directory symlinks during license file search
      [Issue #401] [PR #554]
    - bug: output can span many lines, making it difficult to read
      [Issue #276] [PR #556]
  * Additional Changes
    - Multiple license assigned ( WITH / OR ) operator [Issue #500]
      [PR #555]
    - Count each package once in grant list [PR #610]
    - move images to distroless static-debian13 [PR #618]
    - bump go-make module and action together [PR #607]
    - add COPYRIGHT and CONTRIBUTORS.md files [PR #606]
    - fail the unit test gate when any platform fails [PR #600]
    - Preserve quoted paths when running tagged installer scripts
      [PR #595]
  * Dependencies
    176 dependency changes (138 updated, 32 added, 6 removed). 29
    vulnerabilities remediated.
